# No Git LFS in this repository.
#
# Cromite's SystemWebView is 297 MB. GitHub refuses any single file over
# 100 MB on push, and LFS is not the way around it here: GitHub's free tier
# gives an account 1 GB of LFS bandwidth a month, so a handful of clones or
# CI runs exhausts the quota and every later "repo sync" fails for everyone.
#
# The APK is fetched at build time instead, by
# vendor/bestrom/tools/fetch-prebuilts.sh, which verifies its size, its
# sha256 and GitHub's release attestation before putting it in place. The
# digest lives in prebuilt/CromiteWebView/CromiteWebView.apk.sha256 and the
# file itself is git-ignored.
#
# LeanType.apk (12.5 MB), Via.apk (4.1 MB) and MiXplorer.apk (5.3 MB) are
# ordinary blobs and stay in git.
